WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.027
Repeated DataFrame logic is a good candidate for a function.

00:00:04.027 --> 00:00:12.932
Summarize_orders receives a DataFrame, creates a large_order flag, groups by channel, and returns total amount,

00:00:12.932 --> 00:00:15.598
row count, and large-order count.

00:00:16.086 --> 00:00:20.003
The caller does not need to know every internal step each time.

00:00:20.003 --> 00:00:24.998
It can simply pass in a compatible DataFrame and receive the summary.

00:00:24.998 --> 00:00:30.290
This is how we begin turning notebook experiments into reusable analytical code.
